{"seq":2,"slug":"induction-motor","title":"感应电动机：无需供电转子的可靠动力","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/nikola-tesla/core-contributions/polyphase-ac-system/induction-motor","wordCount":1555,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"感应电动机-无需供电转子的可靠动力\">感应电动机：无需供电转子的可靠动力</h1><p>如果说旋转磁场是特斯拉交流体系的物理原理，那么感应电动机（induction motor，又称异步电动机）就是把这一原理变成可以批量制造、卖给工厂的硬件。1888 年 5 月 16 日，特斯拉在美国电气工程师学会的演讲《一种新的交流电动机与变压器系统》中首次公开了这一发明；同年 7 月，乔治·威斯汀豪斯买下了相关专利。一个多世纪过去，感应电动机仍是世界上应用最广的电动机类型，从家用洗衣机到工厂传送带，背后转动的多半就是它。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>感应电动机的精妙之处在于：转子本身不接任何电源。定子产生的旋转磁场切割转子导条，在其中感应出电流，这股电流又与旋转磁场相互作用产生转矩，把转子拖着转。整个过程靠的是法拉第电磁感应定律，所以转子可以做成一个完全封闭、没有任何外接引线的实心结构。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;  P[定子三相绕组] --&gt; M[旋转磁场]&#10;  M --&gt; C[磁场切割转子导条]&#10;  C --&gt; I[转子导条中感应出电流]&#10;  I --&gt; T[感应电流与磁场作用产生转矩]&#10;  T --&gt; RT[转子旋转但略慢于磁场]&#10;  RT --&gt; C\">flowchart TB\n  P[定子三相绕组] --&gt; M[旋转磁场]\n  M --&gt; C[磁场切割转子导条]\n  C --&gt; I[转子导条中感应出电流]\n  I --&gt; T[感应电流与磁场作用产生转矩]\n  T --&gt; RT[转子旋转但略慢于磁场]\n  RT --&gt; C</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>转子类型</th>\n<th>结构特点</th>\n<th>主要优点</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>鼠笼式转子</td>\n<td>铜或铝导条嵌于铁芯，两端短路环连接</td>\n<td>结构最简单、最坚固、几乎免维护</td>\n<td>绝大多数工业与民用场合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>绕线式转子</td>\n<td>转子上绕三相绕组，经滑环外接电阻</td>\n<td>启动转矩大、可调速</td>\n<td>起重机、大型风机等重载启动场合</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"转差率-感应电动机的工作前提\">转差率：感应电动机的工作前提</h2><p>感应电动机有一个根本性的特征：转子的转速 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 永远略低于旋转磁场的同步转速 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。原因很直接——如果转子追上了磁场，两者之间就没有相对运动，磁场不再切割导条，也就感应不出电流和转矩了。这种&quot;必须落后才能工作&quot;的特性，用转差率（slip）<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 来量化：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s = \\frac{n_s - n}{n_s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>空载时转子几乎跟上磁场，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 趋近于 0；满载时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 通常在 0.02 到 0.06 之间，即转子比磁场慢百分之几。正因为转速与磁场不同步，感应电动机又被称为异步电动机。转差率的存在不是缺陷，而是这类电机产生转矩的必要条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"转矩-转差特性与启动问题\">转矩-转差特性与启动问题</h2><p>感应电动机的电磁转矩 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 与转差率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 之间存在一条特征曲线。在工作区段，转矩近似与转差成正比；当转差增大到某一临界值后，转矩反而下降。这条曲线决定了电机的两个关键行为：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>启动瞬间，转子静止，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>，此时感应电流极大，启动电流可达额定值的 5 到 7 倍，但鼠笼式电机的启动转矩却不算高</li>\n<li>正常运行时，电机能在负载变化时自动调整转差以匹配所需转矩，表现出良好的自稳定性</li>\n</ul>\n<p>启动电流过大是工程上需要专门处理的问题。常见对策包括星-三角降压启动、自耦变压器启动，以及对绕线式电机串入转子电阻。这些技术细节在特斯拉的时代尚未完善，却是后来电机工程的标准内容。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为何如此可靠耐用\">为何如此可靠耐用</h2><p>感应电动机能统治工业界一个多世纪，核心原因是它在结构上消除了直流电机最脆弱的部件——换向器和电刷。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>鼠笼式转子是一个没有引线、没有触点的封闭整体，唯一的机械磨损只发生在两端轴承</li>\n<li>没有换向火花，意味着可以在多尘、潮湿甚至有可燃气体的恶劣环境中安全运行</li>\n<li>结构简单带来低成本与高可靠：一台工业感应电动机正常使用寿命可达数十年，维护几乎只是定期更换轴承和润滑</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这种&quot;皮实耐用&quot;的品质，使它成为二十世纪工业自动化最理想的通用动力源。特斯拉本人对此颇为自豪，他在专利说明中反复强调这种电机&quot;结构简单、不易损坏&quot;的特点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"现代延续与电动汽车的回归\">现代延续与电动汽车的回归</h2><p>进入二十一世纪，感应电动机不仅没有过时，反而在新场景中焕发活力。最具象征意义的是：以特斯拉命名的电动汽车公司，其早期车型 Roadster 和 Model S 的驱动电机采用的正是交流感应电动机。这既是对这位发明家的致敬，也说明感应电动机在高效、高可靠、无稀土永磁体依赖等方面仍具竞争力。</p>\n<p>当然，现代变频驱动（VFD）技术彻底改变了感应电动机的使用方式：通过电力电子器件灵活调节供电频率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span>，工程师可以让原本&quot;定速&quot;的感应电动机实现平滑调速，从而把它从恒速场合拓展到电梯、电动车、精密机床等需要变速的领域。特斯拉当年只能依靠极对数来设定转速，而今天一块变频器就能动态改变同步转速 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>60</mn><mi>f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_s = 60f/p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>，这正是他的原始发明与现代电力电子结合后释放出的巨大潜力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>感应电动机的转子不接电源，靠旋转磁场感应出电流产生转矩，体现了纯粹的电磁感应原理</li>\n<li>转子转速永远略低于同步转速，用转差率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s = (n_s - n)/n_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 量化，&quot;异步&quot;是其工作的必要条件</li>\n<li>鼠笼式结构消除了换向器与电刷，带来极高的可靠性和数十年的使用寿命，统治工业界一个多世纪</li>\n<li>现代变频驱动让感应电动机实现平滑调速，电动汽车的回归更印证了特斯拉这一发明的持久生命力</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"感应电动机：无需供电转子的可靠动力","id":"感应电动机-无需供电转子的可靠动力"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"转差率：感应电动机的工作前提","id":"转差率-感应电动机的工作前提"},{"level":2,"text":"转矩-转差特性与启动问题","id":"转矩-转差特性与启动问题"},{"level":2,"text":"为何如此可靠耐用","id":"为何如此可靠耐用"},{"level":2,"text":"现代延续与电动汽车的回归","id":"现代延续与电动汽车的回归"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"旋转磁场：特斯拉交流电机的物理核心","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/nikola-tesla/core-contributions/polyphase-ac-system/rotating-magnetic-field"},"next":{"title":"多相输配电系统：现代电网的技术蓝图","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/nikola-tesla/core-contributions/polyphase-ac-system/polyphase-power-system"}}